        <item>
            <title>3.9.5</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:24:05 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>152</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.9.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.9.5</h2><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Preserve Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) models across tabs and sessions</li><li>Prevent denied cloud retries for enhanced privacy</li><li>Show ready status for offline AI configurations</li><li>Handle permanent processing failures more robustly</li><li>Accept raw document exports from iWork applications</li><li>Clarify Bring Your Own Key and Ollama AI error messages</li><li>Enforce BYOK state and block cloud analysis when Ollama is active</li><li>Stop AI fallback for moderated content</li></ul>
]]></description>
